1
00:00:36,810 --> 00:00:42,710
[She's Wild Fire]

2
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:47,730
[Episode 10: Can We Turn Pretend
Into Something Real?]

3
00:00:52,280 --> 00:00:53,400
Spit it out.

4
00:00:56,080 --> 00:00:57,200
Xie Nanfeng,

5
00:00:58,160 --> 00:01:00,080
why do you still have to

6
00:01:00,440 --> 00:01:02,200
fight me on everything?

7
00:01:03,640 --> 00:01:05,970
What does this factory
have to do with you?

8
00:01:10,360 --> 00:01:12,440
Just because you've got money,
you think you're somebody?

9
00:01:12,440 --> 00:01:13,300
Let me tell you,

10
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:15,080
I've got money too.

11
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:17,160
I'll be straight with you—

12
00:01:17,160 --> 00:01:19,080
I can even handle Director Zhang

13
00:01:19,330 --> 00:01:20,789
at the credit department.

14
00:01:28,080 --> 00:01:29,410
Hello, Director Zhang.

15
00:01:30,080 --> 00:01:30,800
Yeah,

16
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:31,640
I wanted to ask

17
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:33,289
if you've received the asset verification

18
00:01:33,289 --> 00:01:35,680
for Factory Director Chang Yongbin.

19
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:36,880
Oh, Director Zhang?

20
00:01:37,479 --> 00:01:38,640
You're still putting on a show.

21
00:01:38,640 --> 00:01:39,770
Go ahead, keep it up.

22
00:01:41,280 --> 00:01:42,479
It can't be approved?

23
00:01:43,039 --> 00:01:43,920
Wait, do you think Director Zhang

24
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:45,520
can be ordered around by you?

25
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:47,420
You really think I'm that stupid?

26
00:01:47,960 --> 00:01:49,000
Understood.

27
00:01:50,320 --> 00:01:51,320
Director Zhang,

28
00:01:56,240 --> 00:01:58,200
listen to me carefully.

29
00:01:58,680 --> 00:02:00,880
I am Chang Yongbin.

30
00:02:01,010 --> 00:02:03,050
From now on, if I want a loan,

31
00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:05,920
you'd better sign off on it.

32
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:07,400
Mr. Chang,

33
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:10,840
your loan doesn't meet our bank's
requirements.

34
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:11,900
I can't approve it.

35
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:13,800
Wait,

36
00:02:14,720 --> 00:02:15,160
Director Zhang,

37
00:02:15,160 --> 00:02:16,090
is it really you?

38
00:02:16,640 --> 00:02:17,200
No, Director Zhang.

39
00:02:17,200 --> 00:02:18,000
I didn't know just now.

40
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:19,400
About the loan you promised before,

41
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:20,200
you can't...

42
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:21,930
Director Zhang!

43
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:23,890
Director Zhang!

44
00:02:25,480 --> 00:02:27,000
Director Zhang!

45
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:28,520
Director Zhang!

46
00:02:35,640 --> 00:02:37,079
Xie Nanfeng,

47
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:40,600
just you wait!

48
00:02:47,920 --> 00:02:49,050
Mr. Chu, here you go.

49
00:02:52,880 --> 00:02:53,600
Mr. Chu,

50
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:55,690
you haven't had breakfast yet.

51
00:02:57,079 --> 00:02:58,000
I told you,

52
00:02:58,600 --> 00:03:00,360
I won't invest in your project.

53
00:03:00,600 --> 00:03:01,400
Mr. Chu,

54
00:03:02,040 --> 00:03:03,520
don't be so quick to say no.

55
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:06,140
You can make your decision

56
00:03:06,320 --> 00:03:07,650
after you've read this.

57
00:03:34,880 --> 00:03:37,880
You know exactly what kind of person
Chang Yongbin is.

58
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:39,780
Why did you choose him?

59
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:41,440
What about you, Xie Nanfeng?

60
00:03:41,640 --> 00:03:43,200
Who are you to question me?

61
00:03:43,920 --> 00:03:45,600
Since you came back to China,

62
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:48,400
which one of the things you've said
has actually been true?

63
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:52,600
So you're backing Chang Yongbin
just to get back at me?

64
00:03:56,040 --> 00:03:57,079
Chu Chunsheng,

65
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:58,880
this is business,

66
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:00,160
not child's play.

67
00:04:00,160 --> 00:04:01,120
Exactly because it's business,

68
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:02,880
trust matters even more to me.

69
00:04:05,320 --> 00:04:07,000
Whose child is Nannan?

70
00:04:16,279 --> 00:04:17,800
Xie Nanfeng

71
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,120
is a shrewd woman.

72
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:21,120
She sticks close to

73
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:22,600
whoever can help her,

74
00:04:23,760 --> 00:04:25,560
and she'll use even her own child

75
00:04:25,640 --> 00:04:27,560
as leverage.

76
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:30,520
I really don't want to lie to you.

77
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:34,159
I don't want to keep you in the dark too.

78
00:04:38,080 --> 00:04:38,800
Fine.

79
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:40,520
Fine. I understand now.

80
00:04:40,520 --> 00:04:42,880
So your support

81
00:04:43,960 --> 00:04:45,480
came with strings attached, Mr. Chu.

82
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:47,000
Then we're done.

83
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:50,200
I'll take back the contract rights
my own way.

84
00:04:53,720 --> 00:04:54,880
Xie Nanfeng,

85
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:56,920
I bet you never thought
the very Mr. Chu you love most

86
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:58,240
would side with me

87
00:04:58,240 --> 00:05:00,000
when you needed her most.

88
00:05:00,310 --> 00:05:04,400
[Contract Signing Ceremony for the Management
of Shencheng No. 1 Garment Factory]

89
00:05:00,700 --> 00:05:02,600
I want you to see for yourself

90
00:05:02,770 --> 00:05:05,770
how I'll use you two cheaters

91
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:07,400
to take back my factory.

92
00:05:11,200 --> 00:05:11,800
Everyone,

93
00:05:12,400 --> 00:05:13,960
we have unanimously decided

94
00:05:13,960 --> 00:05:15,720
to award the contract to
Comrade Chang Yongbin

95
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:18,160
to operate Shencheng
No. 1 Garment Factory.

96
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:18,800
Now,

97
00:05:18,880 --> 00:05:20,810
let's give a warm round of applause

98
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,440
as Comrade Chang Yongbin comes up

99
00:05:22,440 --> 00:05:24,680
to sign this contracting agreement.

100
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:27,200
Thank you.

101
00:05:27,200 --> 00:05:28,400
Thank you, Director.

102
00:05:28,520 --> 00:05:29,440
Thank you, Secretary.

103
00:05:29,440 --> 00:05:30,570
Thank you, leaders.

104
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:42,200
Wait!

105
00:05:47,320 --> 00:05:48,400
Xie Nanfeng?

106
00:05:51,320 --> 00:05:52,400
How did you get in?

107
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:55,820
Where's security?

108
00:05:56,020 --> 00:05:57,950
Get this troublemaker out of here!

109
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:07,480
Xie Nanfeng,

110
00:06:07,960 --> 00:06:09,680
don't think you can take over this factory

111
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:11,480
just because you barged in here.

112
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:14,160
The entity you've set up for the contract

113
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:16,560
doesn't meet the eligibility requirements.

114
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:18,890
Without a qualified contracting entity,

115
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:21,560
you can't take over the factory either.

116
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:26,580
Who says she doesn't have one?

117
00:06:30,050 --> 00:06:30,730
Mr. Chu?

118
00:06:36,390 --> 00:06:38,230
I must've been out of my damn mind

119
00:06:38,280 --> 00:06:40,440
to believe you were my so-called partner.

120
00:06:40,440 --> 00:06:42,560
So it was all a lie
from the very beginning!

121
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:43,120
Then tell me—

122
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:44,780
what between us was ever real?

123
00:06:49,080 --> 00:06:50,159
You dare to hit me?

124
00:06:50,400 --> 00:06:50,920
Yes.

125
00:06:51,240 --> 00:06:52,520
And I meant to.

126
00:07:05,420 --> 00:07:06,140
Let's go.

127
00:07:12,440 --> 00:07:13,640
What is this, an Oscar audition?

128
00:07:13,640 --> 00:07:14,440
He's leaving.

129
00:07:18,240 --> 00:07:19,040
He's leaving?

130
00:07:25,420 --> 00:07:26,140
Let me see.

131
00:07:27,960 --> 00:07:30,000
Did I hit you too hard?

132
00:07:30,560 --> 00:07:31,400
Does it hurt?

133
00:07:32,159 --> 00:07:32,880
It's fine.

134
00:07:33,530 --> 00:07:37,570
Honestly, I think I could
take a couple more.

135
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:47,650
Are you sure this act of ours

136
00:07:48,080 --> 00:07:50,960
will actually fool Chang Yongbin?

137
00:07:50,960 --> 00:07:52,040
Of course.

138
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:54,080
Do you really think he's as sharp as you?

139
00:07:54,080 --> 00:07:55,320
You saw right away that the DNA report

140
00:07:55,320 --> 00:07:56,800
he gave you was fake.

141
00:07:56,960 --> 00:07:59,400
Now we just play along,

142
00:07:59,400 --> 00:08:01,320
play the long game,

143
00:08:01,320 --> 00:08:03,720
and wait for him to walk
right into our trap.

144
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:06,610
Secretary Wang,

145
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:10,120
I've transferred 85% of my shares
in Chunsheng Industries

146
00:08:10,120 --> 00:08:11,800
to Ms. Xie Nanfeng.

147
00:08:12,600 --> 00:08:13,880
Ms. Xie Nanfeng

148
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:16,770
is now the majority shareholder
of Chunsheng Industries,

149
00:08:16,770 --> 00:08:17,670
making her fully qualified

150
00:08:17,670 --> 00:08:19,400
to take on the factory contract

151
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:21,560
through the company.

152
00:08:27,220 --> 00:08:28,600
Here are the share transfer agreement

153
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:29,930
and the proof of assets.

154
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:31,620
Please take a look.

155
00:08:32,400 --> 00:08:33,260
Mr. Chu, you...

156
00:08:45,640 --> 00:08:47,000
I've been played!

157
00:08:48,560 --> 00:08:49,760
Comrade Xie Nanfeng,

158
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:51,280
we've verified your contracting entity,

159
00:08:51,280 --> 00:08:52,480
and everything

160
00:08:52,800 --> 00:08:54,460
is fully legal and compliant.

161
00:08:54,680 --> 00:08:55,480
Secretary...

162
00:08:55,960 --> 00:08:56,720
Everyone,

163
00:08:57,520 --> 00:08:58,800
what I have here

164
00:08:59,080 --> 00:09:01,280
is evidence that Chang Yongbin,

165
00:09:01,280 --> 00:09:03,240
during his time as factory director,

166
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:05,840
embezzled funds, took bribes,
and falsified the books.

167
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:06,880
Someone like him

168
00:09:07,280 --> 00:09:09,280
is not qualified to
take on the factory contract.

169
00:09:09,280 --> 00:09:09,680
Xie Nanfeng,

170
00:09:09,680 --> 00:09:10,810
stop slandering me!

171
00:09:12,160 --> 00:09:13,560
Slander you?

172
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:15,640
The evidence speaks for itself.

173
00:09:16,560 --> 00:09:18,000
This is not true!

174
00:09:18,280 --> 00:09:19,240
This is not true!

175
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:20,560
This is all the evidence
of him bribing the cashier

176
00:09:20,560 --> 00:09:21,760
to falsify the books,

177
00:09:21,800 --> 00:09:24,240
colluding with suppliers to

178
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:25,080
pass off inferior goods
as quality products,

179
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:27,000
and pocketing the difference.

180
00:09:27,640 --> 00:09:28,600
Am I wrong?

181
00:09:30,440 --> 00:09:32,000
How did you get all this?

182
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:33,120
Chang Yongbin,

183
00:09:33,120 --> 00:09:34,120
while you were busy fabricating evidence

184
00:09:34,120 --> 00:09:35,040
and framing me,

185
00:09:35,040 --> 00:09:37,640
Chunsheng and I had already
set our plan in motion.

186
00:09:37,640 --> 00:09:39,680
He played along with you
to uncover your entire network

187
00:09:39,680 --> 00:09:41,040
and help me gather the evidence.

188
00:09:41,040 --> 00:09:42,680
While you were basking in your victory,
I dug up every dirty thing you'd ever done

189
00:09:42,680 --> 00:09:44,400
and kept a record of it all.

190
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:45,920
I want you to know

191
00:09:46,020 --> 00:09:48,820
that the worst pain isn't
never having something.

192
00:09:48,890 --> 00:09:52,560
It's having it within reach,
only to watch it all come crashing down.

193
00:09:52,560 --> 00:09:53,880
That's what makes it truly devastating.

194
00:09:53,880 --> 00:09:54,680
Director Liu,

195
00:09:56,640 --> 00:09:58,040
this is all true.

196
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:05,280
It is now decided to cancel Chang Yongbin's
contracting qualification.

197
00:10:05,280 --> 00:10:05,800
No,

198
00:10:05,920 --> 00:10:06,850
Secretary, I...

199
00:10:06,920 --> 00:10:08,800
Ms. Xie Nanfeng

200
00:10:08,800 --> 00:10:10,400
will take on the contract
through Chunsheng Industries

201
00:10:10,400 --> 00:10:12,860
to operate Shencheng No. 1
Garment Factory.

202
00:10:13,080 --> 00:10:13,720
Good!

203
00:10:14,040 --> 00:10:14,560
Good!

204
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:15,680
Good.

205
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:18,800
No.

206
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:20,580
I am the factory director.

207
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:22,060
I am the factory director.

208
00:10:22,360 --> 00:10:23,440
I am!
